{"id":"question-math-linear-function-graph-10","subject":"math","type":"single-choice","prompt":"若一次函數 y=2x+b 的圖形與 y 軸交於 (0,-5)，則 b 為何？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"-10"},{"id":"B","text":"-5"},{"id":"C","text":"2"},{"id":"D","text":"5"}],"knowledgeIds":["kg-math-content-f-8-2"],"difficulty":"easy","answer":{"value":"B","explanation":"與 y 軸交點的 x=0，代入得 y=b；因交點為 (0,-5)，所以 b=-5。"},"provenance":{"origin":"original","license":"All rights reserved","sourceUrl":"https://www.csjh.kh.edu.tw/teach/exam/107%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%B8%E6%9C%9F%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AC%A1%E6%AE%B5%E8%80%83/%E6%95%B8%E5%AD%B8/%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E7%B4%9A%E6%95%B8%E5%AD%B8%E8%A9%A6%E9%A1%8CB4.pdf","sourceLocator":"高雄市立中山國中 107 學年度下學期第三次段考數學科第 5、6 題的截距判讀能力；本題重新設計","authoringNote":"獨立改編，非原題重製。"},"reviewStatus":"draft","updatedAt":"2026-08-28","lessonId":"lesson-math-linear-function-graph"}
